# Raw benchmark output (./run.sh) stays local by default. A run whose
# numbers are published is committed on purpose, with
#   git add -f results/<run>.jsonl results/<run>.txt
# (results/README.md); tracked files stay tracked.
results/*
!results/README.md

# Build outputs of the four programs
rust/target/
rust/Cargo.lock
zig/zig-out/
zig/zig-out-own/
zig/.zig-cache/
java/target/
__pycache__/
